{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:14.70.010","page_type":"section"},"citation":"14.70.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.70.010","content_hash":"e33d96c0cf233afebd0aec301d9c3dde7beacc73cf55ef4940b4b64d65113740","heading":"Definitions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.010:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.70.010","text":"The following words, terms and phrases, when used in this chapter, shall have the meanings ascribed to them in this section, except where the context clearly indicates a different meaning:\n“Building” or “structure” means any construction artificially built up or composed of parts joined together in some definite manner.\n“Moving permit” means the permit issued by the Development Coordination Office permitting a structure to move over public streets or alleys. (Ord. 16513 § 1(10-524), 9-15-92. Code 1995 § 26-581.)\nCross References: Definitions generally, TMC 1.10.020 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"b805b990-0841-5ba5-a760-697fa358cd62"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.70.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.70.010","content_hash":"5c0d162fbb972f59649a6e460c42d2fe7d099c2a41298b3b0fb65b74bc4eacb1","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.010:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.70.010","text":"The following words, terms and phrases, when used in this chapter, shall have the meanings ascribed to them in this section, except where the context clearly indicates a different meaning:"